{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":20684,"num_turns":2,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"794af2e6-9c4a-50ed-9350-1c57b3cea6f0","total_cost_usd":0.25308200000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8302,"cache_read_input_tokens":905,"output_tokens":1624,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8302,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1624,"cache_read_input_tokens":905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8302},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4847,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0049169999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-fable-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1624,"cacheReadInputTokens":905,"cacheCreationInputTokens":8302,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.24816500000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"declaration_consistent\":true,\"selected_report_demonstration\":\"issue\",\"lock_follows_declaration\":true,\"reasons\":[\"Declared independent-unit column module_id is consistent with the frozen data in both arms: six nanocoat modules (PV-C01..PV-C06) and six bare modules (PV-U01..PV-U06) each appear exactly five times (weeks 1-5), 60 rows total, with no module in both arms.\",\"The selected report demonstrates the issue: it states the two-sample Student t-test was run 'with each of the 60 inspection records entered as one independent observation' and reports t(58), i.e., degrees of freedom from 60 rows rather than 12 independent modules.\",\"The per-module table (5 inspections per module) and group summary (30 records per arm from only 6 modules each) in the report make the repeated-measures structure explicit, so the correlated rows entering scipy.stats.ttest_ind as independent is shown in the report itself, not merely inferable from the workflow.\",\"The minted lock's authorized_key_columns [\\\"module_id\\\"] exactly matches the declared independent-unit column, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone; per its stated limitations the lock does not establish numerical impact or scientific correctness and does not cure the demonstrated dependence.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"issue","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["Declared independent-unit column module_id is consistent with the frozen data in both arms: six nanocoat modules (PV-C01..PV-C06) and six bare modules (PV-U01..PV-U06) each appear exactly five times (weeks 1-5), 60 rows total, with no module in both arms.","The selected report demonstrates the issue: it states the two-sample Student t-test was run 'with each of the 60 inspection records entered as one independent observation' and reports t(58), i.e., degrees of freedom from 60 rows rather than 12 independent modules.","The per-module table (5 inspections per module) and group summary (30 records per arm from only 6 modules each) in the report make the repeated-measures structure explicit, so the correlated rows entering scipy.stats.ttest_ind as independent is shown in the report itself, not merely inferable from the workflow.","The minted lock's authorized_key_columns [\"module_id\"] exactly matches the declared independent-unit column, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone; per its stated limitations the lock does not establish numerical impact or scientific correctness and does not cure the demonstrated dependence."]},"ttft_ms":7664,"ttft_stream_ms":1839,"time_to_request_ms":15,"type":"result","duration_ms":21274,"uuid":"b5499976-7377-4df9-87cf-fdbcb8f0abde"}
